        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Istanbul, Turkey, Beyoğlu, Zeytinburnu, Yedikule, İstiklal Avenue\n- Buildings: Mısır Apartment, Abdi İpekçi Arena\n\nFacts:\n- Mısır Apartment, or Mısır Apartmanı, is a famed historical building on İstiklal Avenue in the Beyoğlu district of Istanbul, Turkey.\n- Mısır Apartmanı is Turkish for \"Egypt Apartment.\"\n- Abdi İpekçi Arena was formerly known as Abdi İpekçi Sports Complex.\n- Abdi İpekçi Arena is a multi-purpose indoor arena in the Zeytinburnu district of Istanbul, Turkey.\n- Abdi İpekçi Arena is situated in Yedikule just outside the ancient city walls of Istanbul.",
